Date: Mon, 9 Mar 2026 16:38:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Unbundle curl.h and load curl DSO by a bare file name

Fedora packages run-time curl library under libcurl.so.4 file name.
---
 zpaqfranz.cpp | 2570 +------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2563 deletions(-)

